<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets calls on ABB.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets calls on ABB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Morgan Stanley A.G. said it has issued 500,000 American-style call warrants, on ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2000 CHF		  PREMIUM	12.12 X</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     16.95 CHF		 GEARING	11.42 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.NOV.98		 PAYDATE	13.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1935 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
